sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Customer
    actor VendorStaff

    participant CustomerApp
    participant VendorApp
    participant API
    participant OrderService
    participant PickupService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Notification

    Customer->>CustomerApp: View Pickup Code

    CustomerApp->>API: GET /orders/{id}/pickup

    API->>PickupService: Get Pickup Details

    PickupService->>DB: Load Pickup Record

    DB-->>PickupService: Pickup Code

    PickupService-->>API: Pickup Details

    API-->>CustomerApp: Pickup Code

    Customer->>VendorStaff: Present Pickup Code

    VendorStaff->>VendorApp: Enter / Scan Code

    VendorApp->>API: POST /pickup/verify

    API->>PickupService: Verify Pickup Code

    PickupService->>DB: Validate Pickup

    alt Code Valid

        PickupService->>OrderService: Complete Order

        OrderService->>DB: Update Order Status

        DB-->>OrderService: Completed

        OrderService->>Notification: Notify Customer

        Notification-->>CustomerApp: Order Completed

        PickupService-->>API: Verification Successful

        API-->>VendorApp: Pickup Confirmed

    else Invalid or Expired Code

        PickupService-->>API: Verification Failed

        API-->>VendorApp: Invalid Pickup Code

    end